/*!
\page p_propertymapping Mapping of Properties to Various Formats

- %ID3v2 tags use a TXXX frame with the key as description unless a frame is
  listed in their column.
- Vorbis Comments are not included in the table because they use the names from
  the *Key* column.
- %MP4 tags use \----:com.apple.iTunes: followed by the key unless another name
  is listed in their column.
- %APE tags use the key unless another name is listed in their column.
- %Matroska tags use the key unless another name is listed in their column. A target
  level can follow the name, e.g. /50 for Album. The default is /30 for Track.
- %RIFF INFO and %ASF tags only support the keys listed in their columns.

| Key                        | %ID3v2                                 | %RIFF | %MP4                                                     | %APE                    | %ASF                              | %Matroska                     |
